  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationThereIsAnErrorTransferringReserves</name>
    <id>584</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Errors occurred while updating document generation periods. For more information, see the &lt;link OpenEventLog>event log&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>هنگام به‌روزرسانی دوره‌های ایجاد سند خطاهایی رخ داد. برای اطلاعات بیشتر به &lt;link OpenEventLog>گزارش رویدادها&lt;/> مراجعه کنید</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>При актуализации периодов формирования документов возникли ошибки. Подробности - см. &lt;link OpenEventLog>Журнал регистрации&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Belge biçimlendirme dönemleri güncellenirken hata oluştu. Ayrıntılar için bkz. &lt;link OpenEventLog>Olay Günlüğü&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Khi cập nhật các giai đoạn lập chứng từ, đã xảy ra lỗi. Để biết chi tiết, xem &lt;link OpenEventLog>Nhật ký.&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Errors occurred while updating document generation periods. For more information, see the &lt;link OpenEventLog>event log&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Errors occurred while updating document generation periods. For more information, see the &lt;link OpenEventLog>event log&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationThereIsAnErrorTransferringReservesExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>586</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
